    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1aec8f06-15ca-4bbd-b70a-865b9b6bd459-image2.png\" /><br />Odd digits: <math><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn></math><br />Even digits: <math><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn></math><br />The number of ways of placing odd digits at even position <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>4</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math><br />The number of ways of placing even digits <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Total number of ways <math><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>180</mn></math>",
